.TH okf-jawn-purge_item 1  "purge_item " 
.SH NAME
okf\-jawn\-purge_item \- Permanently remove one item\*(Aqs bytes, derivatives, index entries and history, rewrite or delete the managed backups that hold it, and mark what referred to it invalidated. Tenant administrator in a human session only.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBokf\-jawn purge_item\fR [\fB\-\-server\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Permanently remove one item\*(Aqs bytes, derivatives, index entries and history, rewrite or delete the managed backups that hold it, and mark what referred to it invalidated. Tenant administrator in a human session only.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-server\fR [default: http://127.0.0.1:7711]

.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR [default: {}]
JSON request, @file, or \- for stdin
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
